WEBVTT

00:01.160 --> 00:04.580
So they are the Summons
that were sent by Syl.

00:05.250 --> 00:06.460
(Takumi's Contracted Beast)
Heavenly Tiger.

00:06.460 --> 00:10.550
An S-rank monster that can freely
roam the sky by controlling the wind.

00:10.550 --> 00:12.510
(Takumi's Contracted Beast)
Thunder Hawk.

00:12.510 --> 00:14.970
(Age: 3, Level 20)
A rather small hawk with golden feathers.

00:14.970 --> 00:19.140
A-rank monster that controls thunder
and has high-speed special attacks.

00:19.140 --> 00:21.230
- What are their names?
- What are their names?

00:22.060 --> 00:23.350
Let me think...

00:24.350 --> 00:26.230
What about Feat and Bolt?

00:26.230 --> 00:28.190
- Feat!
- Bolt!

00:30.530 --> 00:32.400
- Nice to meet you!
- There, there!

00:32.400 --> 00:34.610
Oh, I just remember,

00:34.610 --> 00:35.610
(Inventory)
I also receive collars for them.

00:40.580 --> 00:45.000
It seems Joule and Feat's collars
facilitate Shrink ability...

00:51.160 --> 00:53.380
Oh, this is great!

00:53.380 --> 00:57.050
Now you can pass as just a common
dog and cat in the middle of the city.

00:57.680 --> 01:00.180
- Alan wants this too!
- Elena wants this too!

01:00.180 --> 01:01.770
Eh?! Do you want to wear them?!

01:02.140 --> 01:05.730
No, no, these are for the animals...

01:05.730 --> 01:09.610
More like, if you wear them,
people will frown at me.

01:09.610 --> 01:10.860
- Sad...
- Sad...

01:10.860 --> 01:11.940
I let them down...?!

01:11.940 --> 01:15.990
(Inventory)
Have the God of Water sent
something in place of a collar?

01:15.990 --> 01:16.660
Huh?

01:21.880 --> 01:23.160
Do you like them?

01:23.160 --> 01:24.200
- Yeah!
- Yeah!

01:24.200 --> 01:25.620
Glad to hear.

01:26.210 --> 01:30.380
(Angelic Pendant)
That pendant has magic attack resistance.

01:30.380 --> 01:35.220
(Ring of Tenacity)
As for the rings, one has resistance
to physical attack,

01:35.220 --> 01:39.090
(Tracing Ring)
and the other shows your location on the map.

01:40.800 --> 01:42.260
(Inventory)
What else is there...

01:42.760 --> 01:44.600
There are also magic bags.

01:44.600 --> 01:46.230
It's not as big as an inventory,

01:46.230 --> 01:47.980
but it holds quite a lot and is practical.

01:50.850 --> 01:53.030
All right, now let's go back to the city.

01:53.030 --> 01:55.380
You two stay in this form, okay?

01:57.530 --> 01:59.110
Bolt, you go inside my shadow.

02:11.710 --> 02:17.190
♪Leisurely, leisurely,
let's slowly familiarize ourselves♪

02:17.190 --> 02:22.700
(A Journey Through Another World:
Raising Kids While Adventuring)

02:23.350 --> 02:28.230
♪The adventure to a new world is beginning♪

02:28.480 --> 02:33.070
♪Into a journey where
we can find fun things♪

02:35.070 --> 02:39.950
♪There are many encounters,
it's so exciting♪

02:39.950 --> 02:46.120
♪If you're with your family,
the things you can do will multiply♪

02:46.120 --> 02:49.040
♪It's okay to worry,
but you must not be overprotective♪

02:49.040 --> 02:52.000
♪I want you to praise me when
I try something and succeed♪

02:52.000 --> 02:54.800
♪It will be a wonderful party
if we can do this and that♪

02:54.800 --> 02:59.680
♪Because we will be together forever♪

03:00.220 --> 03:03.470
♪Please pat my head♪

03:03.470 --> 03:05.970
♪With your hand that I truly love♪

03:05.970 --> 03:11.900
♪I will send you thank you from
the deepest part of my heart, okay?♪

03:11.900 --> 03:14.610
♪Please pat me more♪

03:14.610 --> 03:17.730
♪See me with those eyes
filled with kindness♪

03:17.730 --> 03:24.070
♪I want this smile to last,
forever and ever♪

03:24.070 --> 03:29.750
♪Leisurely, leisurely,
let's slowly walk on♪

03:30.250 --> 03:35.630
♪Leisurely, Yururing,
I am happy, Travel Days♪

03:38.730 --> 03:42.220
(Monsters, Defeat Them!)

03:42.220 --> 03:42.660
(Monsters, Defeat Them!)
- Here! - Here!

03:42.660 --> 03:43.050
- Here! - Here!

03:44.140 --> 03:45.850
Okay. You may pass.

03:45.850 --> 03:46.970
- Thank you!
- Thank you!

03:48.180 --> 03:51.350
They look so happy having
their own things.

04:04.320 --> 04:06.020
Elena, what's wrong?

04:09.650 --> 04:11.010
Want to go in?

04:11.570 --> 04:12.460
Yes.

04:12.960 --> 04:16.670
Joule and Feat,
wait in the shadow for a bit, okay?

04:20.370 --> 04:21.590
Welcome!

04:28.440 --> 04:30.030
Sorry.

04:30.030 --> 04:33.210
Can we use that ribbon as
a hair accessory?

04:33.210 --> 04:36.150
Yes. One costs 50 Gold.

04:36.150 --> 04:37.810
Come closer, Elena.

04:45.240 --> 04:46.870
Oh my, what a cutie!

04:47.310 --> 04:49.700
Here, look at yourself here.

04:52.910 --> 04:55.080
- Do you like it?
- Yes!

04:55.830 --> 04:58.170
Then let's buy several more.

05:04.080 --> 05:05.340
This one!

05:05.340 --> 05:07.300
Huh? Do you want black?

05:07.300 --> 05:09.680
But there are pink and red...

05:10.310 --> 05:12.640
- It's your color!
- Mine?

05:12.640 --> 05:16.350
Oh, you mean it's the same color
as your brother's hair, right?

05:16.900 --> 05:19.460
So you really love your big brother.

05:19.460 --> 05:20.320
Yeah!

05:21.020 --> 05:22.280
I see!

05:22.280 --> 05:25.320
All right, then. Let's take that one too!

05:25.320 --> 05:27.450
Thank you very much!

05:27.450 --> 05:29.370
Alan, do you want anything?

05:33.790 --> 05:35.790
Well, he's a boy after all...

05:35.790 --> 05:37.580
By the way, Mister.

05:38.560 --> 05:42.000
You see, I have a favor to ask...

05:42.000 --> 05:44.010
Sure, what is it?

05:44.010 --> 05:47.460
Could you put these on them?

05:49.220 --> 05:51.050
That's awesome! So good!

05:52.260 --> 05:54.020
So cute!

05:55.740 --> 05:56.980
Those look good too!

05:57.810 --> 05:59.940
Goodness me, this is cute too!

06:01.060 --> 06:02.480
Oh my!

06:04.140 --> 06:06.440
Awesome! That's good!

06:07.350 --> 06:09.600
Did you make all of them?

06:09.600 --> 06:12.240
Indeed, because I am also a tailor.

06:12.600 --> 06:15.480
Once I saw these kids,
I wanted them to wear it.

06:16.840 --> 06:18.580
- Feat!
- Joule!

06:19.710 --> 06:20.540
- It seems they like these the most.

06:20.540 --> 06:22.460
- Feat! Feat! - Joule! Joule!
- It seems they like these the most.

06:22.460 --> 06:23.100
- Feat! Feat! - Joule! Joule!

06:23.100 --> 06:25.850
Excuse me, could you sell these to me?

06:25.850 --> 06:26.800
Of course!

06:27.380 --> 06:29.760
It really looks good on them.

06:37.770 --> 06:40.770
I also want to buy something for Alan,

06:40.770 --> 06:42.610
but I wonder what will be good for a boy?

06:44.200 --> 06:47.040
As for what I used to get...

06:47.920 --> 06:48.680
(The Working Vehicles)

06:48.680 --> 06:51.050
(The Working Vehicles)
None of them exists in this world.

06:52.720 --> 06:54.020
Let's think about it later.

06:57.990 --> 07:00.120
- Good morning!
- Big Bro!

07:00.120 --> 07:01.880
Wake up!

07:02.290 --> 07:03.920
- Good morning...
- Good morning. Big Bro!

07:06.730 --> 07:07.920
Such splendid weather!

07:07.920 --> 07:10.840
Today is our first
monster-hunting expedition.

07:10.840 --> 07:13.850
We will thin out the monsters
endangering the people,

07:13.850 --> 07:16.680
- Here.
- survey nests and clean up the area.

07:16.680 --> 07:19.560
So we'll head to the dangerous
A-rank forest, the Forest of Gaia.

07:21.240 --> 07:23.230
Here in Shireen City,

07:23.230 --> 07:26.750
the hunting squad is often formed
by the knights and adventurers,

07:26.750 --> 07:29.240
so we also got drafted in.

07:29.720 --> 07:31.810
It's all because of Sir Vault.

07:33.390 --> 07:35.030
Preparations completed.

07:35.040 --> 07:36.870
All right, be on standby.

07:36.870 --> 07:37.990
Yes, Sir.

07:37.990 --> 07:40.580
Good morning, Sir Vault.

07:41.080 --> 07:42.920
Oh! There you are!

07:43.170 --> 07:44.710
The kids are here too!

07:44.710 --> 07:46.880
We got the quest,
it's obvious that we're here.

07:47.630 --> 07:51.640
Moreover, you asked me knowing well
that I'll be with the kids.

07:53.160 --> 07:54.280
I guess I did.

07:54.290 --> 07:56.350
So this is Takumi, correct?

07:56.350 --> 08:00.930
Good day, I'm the vice-captain,
Issac Risner.

08:01.270 --> 08:02.520
Nice to meet you.

08:03.930 --> 08:06.800
My captain forced you
to take the quest, right?

08:06.800 --> 08:08.310
Well, kind of...

08:09.360 --> 08:11.860
Sorry, he's always like that.

08:12.350 --> 08:15.270
It is my pleasure that you gave in
and kindly joined us.

08:16.190 --> 08:18.020
Honestly, this man is so hopeless...

08:18.030 --> 08:19.580
Don't look at me like that!

08:20.070 --> 08:23.900
Well, I think it will be a good
experience for us too.

08:23.900 --> 08:27.540
That aside, I can't believe
these young kids are adventurers.

08:27.940 --> 08:29.380
Don't you worry, Issac.

08:30.210 --> 08:31.880
You guys are strong, right?

08:32.330 --> 08:32.970
Wha-!

08:32.970 --> 08:36.390
Captain, please don't scare the kids.

08:37.250 --> 08:38.660
I'm sorry.

08:38.670 --> 08:41.270
They're not used to having
many people around,

08:41.270 --> 08:43.640
so they seem a bit nervous.

08:43.640 --> 08:45.600
There you go.

08:45.600 --> 08:48.360
- Both of you, it's okay.
- Stare...

08:48.360 --> 08:51.570
- Okay, guys! We'll be leaving soon!
- Stare...

08:52.050 --> 08:54.560
We will use carriages
to the Forest of Gaia.

08:54.560 --> 08:56.660
You'll be in the same carriage as us.

08:57.010 --> 08:57.800
Okay.

09:00.770 --> 09:02.150
What's this feeling?

09:02.150 --> 09:05.150
Someone is giving us an unsettling stare.

09:06.420 --> 09:08.880
It seems Alan and Elena also feel it.

09:09.880 --> 09:11.090
Hostility?

09:11.100 --> 09:13.890
Or is it wariness or dissatisfaction?

09:14.920 --> 09:16.300
Something wrong?

09:16.300 --> 09:18.010
No, nothing.

09:18.760 --> 09:22.140
Well, there are surely people
who dislike people with kids.

09:24.790 --> 09:28.340
We will arrive at the Forest of Gaia
within an hour.

09:29.100 --> 09:31.500
It might be boring, are you guys okay?

09:31.500 --> 09:32.690
- Yes.
- Yes.

09:32.690 --> 09:34.960
So you're Alan and Elena, yeah?

09:34.960 --> 09:37.970
We've heard stories.
Let's work together.

09:40.660 --> 09:41.620
- Yes.
- Yes.

09:41.620 --> 09:44.560
They seem to have calmed down.

09:44.560 --> 09:45.700
What a relief.

09:47.420 --> 09:49.170
From this point, it's the Forest of Gaia.

09:49.970 --> 09:51.970
The hunting is planned to last five days.

09:51.970 --> 09:54.730
First, we split into three squads
going to different routes,

09:54.740 --> 09:56.420
all heading to the camping ground.

09:56.930 --> 09:58.590
- Takumi.
- Yes?

09:58.590 --> 10:01.770
I gonna introduce you to
not only the knights,

10:01.770 --> 10:04.020
but also other adventurers
in the squad.

10:06.520 --> 10:09.840
I'm Rudolf of the Dragon Breath.
Nice to meet you.

10:09.840 --> 10:11.510
I'm Iris.

10:11.510 --> 10:12.760
I'm Gilm.

10:12.760 --> 10:14.230
Zach. Nice to meet you.

10:14.230 --> 10:16.440
I am Takumi of the White Wings.

10:16.900 --> 10:18.700
This is Alan and Elena.

10:18.700 --> 10:20.910
Sir Rudolf is an A-rank adventurer.

10:21.360 --> 10:23.320
Wow! You're amazing!

10:23.320 --> 10:24.870
I'm honored to work with you.

10:24.870 --> 10:25.900
Yeah.

10:25.900 --> 10:29.120
Okay, let's be off!
Don't get left behind.

10:33.090 --> 10:35.300
- Over there.
- It's coming.

10:35.300 --> 10:38.380
Sir Vault, the monsters are
coming from the left side.

10:40.970 --> 10:42.470
There's nothing there.

10:42.470 --> 10:43.930
They are still a bit far.

10:44.420 --> 10:46.460
But you will see them soon.

10:46.460 --> 10:49.130
Gilm, can you feel them with Detect?

10:49.130 --> 10:51.470
No, I find nothing.

10:52.650 --> 10:58.360
Detect is a skill that spreads one's magic
to detect the magic of others.

10:59.060 --> 11:02.400
Meanwhile, Alan and Elena's
skill is Perception.

11:02.400 --> 11:08.000
It detects when something with
harmful intentions comes into range.

11:08.420 --> 11:11.170
The two's area of detection is very wide.

11:11.170 --> 11:15.800
That's why, they can detect something
that has not yet triggered his Detect.

11:17.060 --> 11:18.510
I can feel it. It's coming!

11:32.440 --> 11:35.520
- Red Wolf!
- Just one?

11:35.520 --> 11:37.610
No, wait!

11:37.610 --> 11:38.690
Oh no!

11:38.690 --> 11:41.910
I forgot to tell them to stay put today!

11:48.070 --> 11:49.540
- We beat it!
- We beat it!

11:52.080 --> 11:54.710
Oh crap, everyone is perplexed.

11:54.710 --> 11:57.170
Moreover, this isn't the labyrinth.

11:57.710 --> 12:01.130
So you two are basically
dragging back a corpse.

12:01.130 --> 12:04.270
Y-Yeah, you did well.

12:04.270 --> 12:05.480
Were you hurt?

12:05.490 --> 12:06.970
- No, we're okay!
- No, we're okay!

12:07.270 --> 12:08.720
There, there.

12:08.720 --> 12:09.830
But listen up.

12:10.190 --> 12:13.020
This time, let Big Bro and
the others fight the monsters,

12:13.740 --> 12:16.560
so can I ask you not to fight?

12:17.570 --> 12:18.980
- Okay...
- Okay...

12:18.980 --> 12:21.860
Hey, Takumi! What the heck happened?

12:22.450 --> 12:25.620
Well, just as you witnessed...

12:25.620 --> 12:27.810
Red Wolf is a C-rank!

12:27.810 --> 12:33.000
Sir Vault, you have seen these kids
beat a C-rank adventurer, right?

12:33.000 --> 12:37.090
I thought he was just being
careless when facing kids!

12:37.100 --> 12:38.880
What?! That's what you think?!

12:39.420 --> 12:44.880
Well, even if that was so,
I've told you how I met them, right?

12:44.880 --> 12:48.140
That you took them in?
What's up with that?

12:48.600 --> 12:50.100
I've told you...

12:50.100 --> 12:52.520
I found them in this Forest of Gaia.

12:53.300 --> 12:54.350
Does that mean...!

12:55.060 --> 12:59.570
You mean that they survived
in this forest all by themselves?

12:59.570 --> 13:01.150
Indeed.

13:01.150 --> 13:06.660
I don't know how they did it.
They may beat or run from the monsters,

13:06.660 --> 13:09.910
but they for sure lived
for a few days in this forest.

13:13.620 --> 13:17.420
These kids have been strong
since the day I met them.

13:24.920 --> 13:27.920
So Takumi and the others have
entered the Forest of Gaia?

13:29.070 --> 13:32.450
I feel so bad to cause them trouble.

13:33.110 --> 13:35.610
But I think Takumi will do just fine.

13:37.450 --> 13:39.990
I pray that you can go home
safe and sound.

13:41.070 --> 13:43.860
Please, God!
Well, I'm the God, though.

13:48.360 --> 13:49.200
Hey, now!

13:49.870 --> 13:52.330
Why did you run suddenly?

13:52.990 --> 13:54.250
- Here!
- Here!

13:54.250 --> 13:55.500
Aren't they Spirit Grass?

13:55.500 --> 13:56.080
(A medicinal grass that holds magic power)

13:56.080 --> 13:58.030
(There are very specific conditions
required to grow it)
We search for it in a quest, right?

13:58.030 --> 13:59.830
(It is prized as an ingredient for magic potions)
You remember well.

13:59.830 --> 14:02.170
Those are really useful.

14:03.510 --> 14:04.480
But...

14:05.340 --> 14:10.680
Right now, we're moving with the others,
so you shouldn't move about too freely.

14:11.970 --> 14:13.350
- We can't?
- We can't?

14:13.390 --> 14:14.600
Ugh!

14:15.150 --> 14:17.610
If you can follow us without
falling behind, then it's fine!

14:19.020 --> 14:20.510
So he said.

14:20.520 --> 14:21.730
- Yay!
- Yay!

14:22.490 --> 14:24.400
Don't go too far away, okay?

14:24.400 --> 14:26.240
- Big Bro!
- Big Bro!

14:28.270 --> 14:29.910
- Take this for us!
- Take this for us!

14:30.460 --> 14:32.780
(Slimy Rock Moss)
Oh, you found Slimy Rock Moss too!

14:33.330 --> 14:34.690
What is that?

14:34.690 --> 14:37.250
It's an ingredient for a drug
that works on itches.

14:37.850 --> 14:42.340
Didn't you regret not applying
the drug on your itch last time?

14:42.920 --> 14:44.710
It's used in that drug.

14:44.710 --> 14:47.920
- Isn't that the common athlete's foot?
- Really?!

14:47.920 --> 14:50.840
Okay! Let's take as much as we can!

14:50.840 --> 14:52.300
Please stop!

14:52.850 --> 14:56.890
If you just take it directly, the spore
will burst and you'll get a rash!

14:57.390 --> 15:02.810
Try thinking of why the children didn't take it
by themselves, and called Takumi instead!

15:02.810 --> 15:04.070
Here we go again.

15:04.070 --> 15:05.270
What's going on?

15:05.270 --> 15:07.690
- The usual preaching time.
- How many times have I told you
not to work on instinct alone?!

15:07.690 --> 15:09.400
- If the captain makes any mess,
it always goes like this.
- How many times have I told you
not to work on instinct alone?!

15:09.400 --> 15:11.220
- If the captain makes any mess,
it always goes like this.
- Why don't you think before you act?!

15:11.220 --> 15:12.450
- Is that so...
- Why don't you think before you act?!

15:15.410 --> 15:17.290
We found quite a lot.

15:17.290 --> 15:18.600
- We found a lot!
- We found a lot!

15:18.600 --> 15:19.900
(Bla, bla, bla, bla)

15:19.900 --> 15:22.270
(Bla, bla, bla, bla)
Is he still preaching over there?

15:22.270 --> 15:22.800
(Bla, bla, bla, bla)

15:22.800 --> 15:25.310
(Bla, bla, bla, bla)
It will probably take
around one more hour.

15:25.310 --> 15:26.320
(Bla, bla, bla, bla)
That long?!

15:28.340 --> 15:30.970
Maybe I should try
my ultimate weapon.

15:31.560 --> 15:32.940
Alan, Elena.

15:34.300 --> 15:35.870
Whisper, whisper...

15:35.890 --> 15:38.430
(Bla, bla, bla, bla)
Listen, I will say this one more time!

15:38.430 --> 15:41.750
(Bla, bla, bla, bla)
You have always, at all times,
used only your instinct...!

15:44.110 --> 15:45.440
What's wrong?

15:46.550 --> 15:48.280
- Here.
- For you!

15:49.130 --> 15:51.090
That's the moss from before...

15:51.090 --> 15:52.240
May I?

15:52.240 --> 15:54.200
- Yeah.
- Sure.

15:55.370 --> 15:57.160
Thank you very much.

15:57.160 --> 15:59.620
All right! Let's proceed!

15:59.620 --> 16:01.430
- We're back!
- We're back!

16:01.430 --> 16:02.670
You did well!

16:04.330 --> 16:05.380
There they are!

16:05.380 --> 16:07.880
Six orcs and one High Orc!

16:10.210 --> 16:12.630
We will handle the High Orc.

16:12.630 --> 16:14.220
Please, Mr. Rudolf!

16:14.630 --> 16:16.740
I will take an orc!

16:16.740 --> 16:18.930
Alone?! You can't do it alone!

16:19.410 --> 16:20.640
I'll be okay!

16:21.520 --> 16:23.270
Wind Cutter!

16:35.950 --> 16:38.660
All right! We beat all of them!

16:38.660 --> 16:40.120
Hey!

16:40.120 --> 16:43.080
How could you instantly kill an orc?

16:43.080 --> 16:45.830
Eh? Well, even if you ask me...

16:50.090 --> 16:55.060
You guys also didn't take that
much time to defeat the orcs.

16:55.060 --> 16:57.690
We have to engage it as a group!

16:57.690 --> 17:00.100
And even then we can't instantly kill it!

17:00.100 --> 17:02.720
There must be a mistake
that you're an F-rank!

17:02.720 --> 17:05.770
Ah, I am now rank E,
one rank above that.

17:05.770 --> 17:07.480
That doesn't change much!

17:08.190 --> 17:09.480
Sir Rudolf!

17:09.480 --> 17:12.110
I will say a word too,
but after we're back in the city,

17:12.110 --> 17:15.210
ask the guild master
to raise his rank!

17:15.210 --> 17:16.450
Understood.

17:16.450 --> 17:19.200
Eh? If Rudolf asks,
my rank will be raised?

17:19.630 --> 17:23.380
Yeah, with the approval of
a high-ranking adventurer,

17:23.380 --> 17:28.140
and by the guild master's authority,
you can have your rank raised to a degree.

17:29.630 --> 17:32.760
By the way, Sir Rudolf,
aren't you curious?

17:32.760 --> 17:37.220
We're still not deep into the forest,
yet we have encountered monster groups.

17:37.220 --> 17:40.010
Yes, you're right.

17:40.010 --> 17:42.810
The forest's atmosphere
also feels a lot quieter.

17:43.250 --> 17:45.340
Is it abnormal?

17:45.340 --> 17:49.430
Yes. Let alone a group,
it's unusual for one to appear.

17:50.150 --> 17:52.280
I wonder if it's an omen.

17:53.360 --> 17:56.370
Maybe it's better
if we investigate with caution.

17:57.200 --> 17:59.450
You're right.
Let's proceed carefully...

17:59.450 --> 18:01.580
- Big Bro! Snacks, please!
- Big Bro! Snacks, please!

18:03.140 --> 18:04.720
You guys are so lax.

18:04.720 --> 18:06.490
S-Sorry...

18:07.030 --> 18:09.800
Nah, let's rest for a while.

18:13.380 --> 18:16.630
Here. Chew it well while you eat, okay?

18:16.630 --> 18:17.470
Hey!

18:18.090 --> 18:19.470
T-That is...

18:20.370 --> 18:22.180
Isn't it the illusionary bread?

18:22.710 --> 18:23.930
Illusionary?

18:23.930 --> 18:25.810
Limited to only 20 every day!

18:25.810 --> 18:28.060
Plus, no one knows when it's sold!

18:28.060 --> 18:30.310
That's why they're being called illusion.

18:30.310 --> 18:32.520
Huh, I didn't know that...

18:32.520 --> 18:34.180
How could you have it?!

18:34.180 --> 18:38.110
Well, they personally made
several for us...

18:38.110 --> 18:41.060
What?! They made it for you?!

18:41.060 --> 18:42.440
But how?!

18:42.440 --> 18:44.200
About that...

18:45.870 --> 18:48.540
Kids... Spare me some...

18:48.540 --> 18:50.200
- No!
- No!

18:50.200 --> 18:52.130
Please don't try to take it from the kids!

18:52.130 --> 18:52.810
(Stare...)

18:52.810 --> 18:55.320
(Stare...)
But still...

18:57.340 --> 18:59.760
Oh, seriously.

18:59.760 --> 19:02.390
(Inventory)
I guess there is enough for everyone here.

19:03.210 --> 19:04.810
This time is an exception, got it?

19:04.810 --> 19:06.470
Seriously?! We can have it?!

19:07.270 --> 19:09.310
Me too! I want it too!

19:10.600 --> 19:11.850
So good, so yummy!

19:11.850 --> 19:12.690
This is so delicious.

19:14.070 --> 19:17.190
Wait, don't forget to keep
watch of the surroundings!

19:17.780 --> 19:20.320
Okay! Let's begin the survey again!

19:20.320 --> 19:22.370
Yeah!

19:22.370 --> 19:25.410
They got so lively just by
a piece of bread...

19:30.900 --> 19:31.840
Captain!

19:31.840 --> 19:33.640
It's the red flare!

19:33.650 --> 19:35.800
That means they're asking for help.

19:35.810 --> 19:37.210
Let's regroup immediately!

19:39.930 --> 19:40.930
What is that?

19:40.930 --> 19:43.760
Something must have happened
to the other group.

19:44.010 --> 19:45.970
But don't use all your energy to run,

19:45.970 --> 19:48.610
we might engage in a battle once we arrive.

19:48.610 --> 19:50.810
But we'd better hurry, right?

19:50.810 --> 19:52.060
Yeah!

19:52.060 --> 19:53.690
Then I will go before you.

19:53.690 --> 19:54.730
Huh?

19:54.730 --> 19:56.070
What will you two do?

19:56.070 --> 19:57.360
- Go with you!
- Go with you!

19:57.360 --> 19:59.610
Surely. Let's go.

19:59.610 --> 20:01.950
Wait, Takumi, what do you...

20:03.360 --> 20:06.870
Dear Wind, wrap around me
and lift me in your gust.

20:07.120 --> 20:08.040
Accelerate!

20:09.250 --> 20:10.540
What, wait!

20:11.920 --> 20:14.050
- Wow!
- So fast!

20:16.470 --> 20:17.630
That's it!

20:17.630 --> 20:20.590
It's the Red Wolf's higher rank,
the Bloody Wolf!

20:21.340 --> 20:23.050
One of them is wounded.

20:23.050 --> 20:24.890
They are in danger.

20:28.350 --> 20:29.200
Let's use this sword this time.

20:29.200 --> 20:30.020
(Water Katana)
Let's use this sword this time.

20:30.020 --> 20:31.080
(Water Katana)

20:31.100 --> 20:34.270
Will you help me, Alan, Elena?

20:34.270 --> 20:35.230
- Yes!
- Yes!

20:35.230 --> 20:36.230
Thank you.

20:36.230 --> 20:37.360
Let's go!

20:52.170 --> 20:53.590
Hey, are you all right?!

20:54.750 --> 20:56.800
W-What the heck happened?!

20:57.350 --> 21:02.400
Takumi, did you guys defeat
all of these Bloody Wolves?!

21:02.400 --> 21:04.450
T-That's right...

21:06.470 --> 21:08.670
I see, thank you.

21:08.670 --> 21:12.960
Actually, I didn't expect
you to be this powerful.

21:13.680 --> 21:15.940
It's simply hard to believe.

21:16.190 --> 21:18.940
You don't look strong at all!

21:18.940 --> 21:21.030
That hurts, Sir Vault.

21:21.030 --> 21:24.200
Captain, the kids might
attack you, you know.

21:26.320 --> 21:28.250
I'm not bullying him!

21:28.620 --> 21:30.530
Alan, Elena.

21:30.530 --> 21:34.830
If the Captain does something funny,
you can just kick him away.

21:34.830 --> 21:36.000
- Okay!
- Okay!

21:36.000 --> 21:38.080
Hey, what the heck
are you telling them?!

21:38.080 --> 21:40.560
Remember to hold back
as you do it, okay?

21:40.570 --> 21:41.590
- Okay!
- Okay!

21:41.590 --> 21:43.590
Why did it come to that?!

21:43.590 --> 21:45.800
Takumi! You should've stopped them!

21:52.930 --> 21:54.180
What's wrong?

21:54.180 --> 21:56.100
No, it's nothing...

21:56.600 --> 21:59.190
Come here, you two.
It's gonna be okay.

22:01.490 --> 22:03.590
What is that just now?

22:03.600 --> 22:05.400
It's the same as what I felt
in the morning.

22:06.080 --> 22:08.330
It's clearly an unpleasant presence.

22:28.590 --> 22:32.510
♪Forever, all the time♪

22:32.510 --> 22:35.720
♪I just can't keep crying♪

22:35.720 --> 22:36.730
♪Ah! Ah!♪

22:36.730 --> 22:40.350
♪In happy moments and sad moments♪

22:40.350 --> 22:42.980
♪If I am with you♪

22:45.280 --> 22:47.320
♪Such a good weather♪

22:47.320 --> 22:50.910
♪Today, let's go slowly♪

22:50.910 --> 22:53.120
♪While taking detours♪

22:53.120 --> 22:57.660
♪The clear sky,
the wind caressing my cheeks♪

22:57.660 --> 23:00.920
♪And your gentle gaze♪

23:00.920 --> 23:04.170
♪Beyond an unknown road♪

23:04.170 --> 23:06.260
♪The wind blows past♪

23:06.260 --> 23:09.260
♪The curtain of light sways♪

23:10.010 --> 23:13.640
♪Maybe we should try going
I just feel like it♪

23:13.640 --> 23:20.100
♪No matter what happens
we can laugh anyway♪

23:22.310 --> 23:26.440
♪Forever, all the time♪

23:26.570 --> 23:29.320
♪I just can't keep crying♪

23:29.320 --> 23:30.570
♪Ah! Ah!♪

23:30.570 --> 23:34.070
♪In happy moments and sad moments♪

23:34.070 --> 23:37.290
♪If I am with you♪

23:38.450 --> 23:43.250
♪I am sure I'll be content♪

23:44.980 --> 23:45.860
(Next Episode)

23:45.860 --> 23:45.940
(Next Episode) (Big Bro is Mad!)

23:45.940 --> 23:48.480
(Next Episode) (Big Bro is Mad!)
- Big Bro! - ...is mad!

23:48.480 --> 23:49.990
(Next Episode) (Big Bro is Mad!)
